{
    "title": "Quincy - Quinceanera Planning",
    "description": "Planning a Quincea\u00f1era event made easy! Quincy is a planner app which helps you organize tasks in checklist, keep budget organized, find event vendors and manage guest list. With Quincy you will complete all task from checklist, pay in time all payments to vendors, not lose any vendor contact and create wishlist, find a perfect dress. Start planning your Quince A\u00f1os now!\r\n\r\nChecklist.\r\nThe ultimate planning checklist helps you to keep tasks organized. Convenient categorization and a notification system will help to organize your Quincea\u00f1era as it was intended.\r\n\r\nBudget Planning.\r\nThe payment calculator helps you stay within budget and keep track of statistics. \r\n\r\nEvent Vendors.\r\nSearch for local vendors that will help with 15 A\u00f1os event planning: planners, decoration, catering, music. There are also venues that will match your dreams for sure!\r\n\r\nQuincea\u00f1era dress.\r\nEvent planning means you need to purchase a lot of things. With the shopping list Quincy makes it easy! Add all necessary for the event: dress, invitations, guest book!  \r\n\r\nGuest list.\r\nImport guests from contacts and manage their RSVP\u2019s. Quinceanera planning is easier when you have a convenient guest list, isn\u2019t it?\r\n\r\nCountdown of days to the Quincea\u00f1era.\r\nCounting days till your event? Now you will always have a beautiful timer!\r\n\r\nQuincea\u00f1era is a special event which is really important to you, your family and friends, so we made an amazing planner app to help you organize it perfectly!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Planning a Quincea\u00f1era event made easy! Quincy is a planner app which helps you organize tasks in checklist, keep budget organized, find event vendors and manage guest list. With Quincy you will complete all task from checklist, pay in time all payments to vendors, not lose any vendor contact and create wishlist, find a perfect dress. Start planning your Quince A\u00f1os now!<br><br>Checklist.<br>The ultimate planning checklist helps you to keep tasks organized. Convenient categorization and a notification system will help to organize your Quincea\u00f1era as it was intended.<br><br>Budget Planning.<br>The payment calculator helps you stay within budget and keep track of statistics. <br><br>Event Vendors.<br>Search for local vendors that will help with 15 A\u00f1os event planning: planners, decoration, catering, music. There are also venues that will match your dreams for sure!<br><br>Quincea\u00f1era dress.<br>Event planning means you need to purchase a lot of things. With the shopping list Quincy makes it easy! Add all necessary for the event: dress, invitations, guest book!  <br><br>Guest list.<br>Import guests from contacts and manage their RSVP\u2019s. Quinceanera planning is easier when you have a convenient guest list, isn\u2019t it?<br><br>Countdown of days to the Quincea\u00f1era.<br>Counting days till your event? Now you will always have a beautiful timer!<br><br>Quincea\u00f1era is a special event which is really important to you, your family and friends, so we made an amazing planner app to help you organize it perfectly!",
